        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CRS100SBR, Modern Acrylic Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Acrylic Door Pull is available with either a clear or frosted acrylic handle and your choice of finish for the brass mounts. This Acrylic Door Handle is available in 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inch lengths in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL04-specifications.gif?v=1704354715\" width=\"586\" height=\"199\" border=\"0\" alt=\"FII CRS100SBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First Impressions CRS100SBR Contemporary Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262325\"><b>First Impressions CRS100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-CRS100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-CRS100018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-CRS100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 22-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Acrylic Door Pull",
                "description": "The Modern Acrylic Door Pull is available with either a clear or frosted acrylic handle and your choice of finish for the brass mounts. This Acrylic Door Handle is available in 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inch lengths in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading.\r\n",
                "keywords": "First Impressions ATL04, Modern Acrylic Door Pulls, FII-ATL04, Atlantic 4 Acrylic Door Handles, Modern Acrylic Door handles, clear acrylic door pulls, frosted acrylic door pulls, modern door pulls, 12 inch door pulls, 18 inch door pulls, 24 inch door pulls, contemporary door pulls, First Impressions ATL04 Contemporary Acrylic Door Pulls, Modern Atlantic Acrylic Door Handles, Atlantic collection series 4, FII-CRS100SBR, First Impressions CRS100SBR, Frist Impressions Crystal 100 Acrylic Handles,"
